taeketvdm:{"n":"Taeke Tjeerds van der Meer","d":"b. c. 1853 · Surhuizum","b":1853,"s":"h","p":["tjeerd","ytjemt"],"r":["nl"],"t":"A labourer, born at Surhuizum. He married Rinske Douwes IJsselstein at Idaarderadeel on 19 May 1880.\n\nHe was 27 at his wedding in 1880 and a labourer (arbeider) at Warga that December, when his first son Tjeerd died at three weeks old. A daughter, Antje, was born in September 1898. He lived at Wartena. On 2 September 1911 he bought a farmhouse and yard (\"een boerenhuis c.a.\") at Warga for 1,925 guilders at a sale before a Leeuwarden notary, in a deed that also names his son-in-law Willem Hazenberg as a buyer. A deed of 1918 calls him a workman (werkman) at Wartena.","src":[["Marriage record, 1880","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:08e7a90a-fddd-8261-ef8c-bb26a9901927"],["Notarial deed, sale at Warga, 2 Sep 1911","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:e7276a39-1269-4e4e-b79c-73df38e0e85f"],["Notarial deed, Warga 1918","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:fbfe975b-d2f8-4910-a25d-28a5bf0a20ab"],["Death of son Tjeerd, Warga 1880","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:58f88c49-5ee2-a1d9-8445-0a18a2db7cb6"],["Birth of daughter Antje, 1898","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:afe33860-baf9-8536-6ff2-7cce1486e0af"]]},
rinske:{"n":"Rinske Douwes IJsselstein","d":"b. c. 1858 · Wartena","b":1858,"s":"h","p":["douwe","froukje"],"r":["nl"],"t":"Born on 30 September 1857, the daughter of Douwe Taekes IJsselstein and Froukje Ulbes Visser; the birth was registered at Idaarderadeel. She was 22 and born at Wartena when she married Taeke Tjeerds van der Meer on 19 May 1880. Their first child, Tjeerd, died at Warga on 24 December 1880, three weeks old; both parents are called labourers in the record. Yttje was born in 1884. The last child, Antje, was born on 3 September 1898, when the couple lived at Warga. A married woman named Rinske IJsselstein, aged 41, died at Idaarderadeel on 31 October 1898, eight weeks after that birth. The age fits her, but the index entry names no husband or parents, so this death is likely hers rather than proven.","src":[["Birth of Rinske IJsselstein, 1857","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:5de11e39-162a-fa49-cf11-81f6c641e3c2"],["Marriage van der Meer-IJsselstein, 1880","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:08e7a90a-fddd-8261-ef8c-bb26a9901927"],["Death of son Tjeerd, Warga 1880","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:58f88c49-5ee2-a1d9-8445-0a18a2db7cb6"],["Birth of daughter Antje, 1898","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:afe33860-baf9-8536-6ff2-7cce1486e0af"],["Death of Rinske IJsselstein, aged 41, 1898","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:bb34f746-a7dd-bec3-0507-d55a8b53602f"]]},
tjeerd:{n:"Tjeerd Taekes van der Meer",d:"b. c. 1823 · Surhuisterveen",b:1823,s:"h",p:["taekem", "auktjen"],r:["nl"],t:"A labourer. Married Ytje Martens Tillema at Achtkarspelen on 18 May 1850.",src:[["Marriage record, 1850", "https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:2abfce7c-7253-19f5-497d-4e2dbf94dd66"]]},
ytjemt:{"n":"Ytje Martens Tillema","d":"c. 1832–1885 · Surhuizum","b":1832,"x":1885,"s":"h","p":[null,"durkjen"],"r":["nl"],"t":"Born at Surhuizum about 1832. Only her mother, Durkjen Simmes Tillema, is named in the records. On 18 May 1850, aged 22, she married Tjeerd Taekes van der Meer of Surhuisterveen at Achtkarspelen. She died at Surhuizum on 26 September 1885, aged 53.","src":[["Marriage, Achtkarspelen, 1850","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:2abfce7c-7253-19f5-497d-4e2dbf94dd66"],["Death record, 1885","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:5860412e-9213-c24b-9c23-1da40705d6b3"]]},
